    "Log out to verify changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Log out to verify changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注销后即可验证更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登出後即可驗證變更。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ログアウトして変更を確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "로그아웃한 뒤 변경 사항을 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melde dich ab, um die Änderungen zu prüfen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnectez-vous pour vérifier les changements."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cierra sesión para comprobar los cambios."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saia da sessão para verificar as alterações."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esci per verificare le modifiche."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Log uit om de wijzigingen te controleren."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Đăng xuất để kiểm tra thay đổi."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ออกจากระบบเพื่อตรวจการเปลี่ยนแปลง"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keluar untuk memverifikasi perubahan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is reporting some menu bar items as hidden or unavailable right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS is reporting some menu bar items as hidden or unavailable right now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 正把部分菜单栏项目报告为隐藏或不可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 正把部分選單列項目回報為隱藏或無法使用。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOSが一部のメニューバー項目を、今は非表示または利用不可と報告しています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS가 일부 메뉴 막대 항목을 지금 가려졌거나 쓸 수 없다고 알립니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS meldet gerade einige Menüleistenobjekte als ausgeblendet oder nicht verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS signale que certains éléments sont masqués ou indisponibles pour le moment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS indica que algunos elementos están ocultos o no disponibles ahora."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS informa que alguns itens estão ocultos ou indisponíveis agora."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS segnala che alcuni elementi sono nascosti o non disponibili in questo momento."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS meldt dat sommige menubalkitems nu verborgen of niet beschikbaar zijn."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS đang báo một số mục thanh menu bị ẩn hoặc không dùng được."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS แจ้งว่ารายการแถบเมนูบางรายการถูกซ่อนหรือใช้ไม่ได้ตอนนี้"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS melaporkan beberapa item bilah menu tersembunyi atau tidak tersedia saat ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may be hiding HaoBar's icon behind the notch or because the menu bar is full. macOS doesn't let apps force their own icon back on screen, so this is fixed at the system level: open Menu Bar settings to manage what's shown, remove or reorder other menu-bar icons, or move HaoBar's icon to the immediate left of Control Center.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS may be hiding HaoBar's icon behind the notch or because the menu bar is full. macOS doesn't let apps force their own icon back on screen, so this is fixed at the system level: open Menu Bar settings to manage what's shown, remove or reorder other menu-bar icons, or move HaoBar's icon to the immediate left of Control Center."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 可能把 HaoBar 的图标藏在刘海后面，或因为菜单栏已满而隐藏。macOS 不允许应用把自己的图标强制拉回屏幕，所以需要在系统层面处理：打开“菜单栏”设置来管理显示内容，移除或重新排列其他菜单栏图标，或把 HaoBar 的图标移到控制中心正左侧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 可能把 HaoBar 的圖示藏在瀏海後面，或因為選單列已滿而隱藏。macOS 不允許 App 把自己的圖示強制拉回螢幕，所以需要在系統層級處理：打開「選單列」設定來管理顯示內容，移除或重新排列其他選單列圖示，或把 HaoBar 的圖示移到控制中心正左側。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may be hiding HaoBar's icons. Check System Settings > Menu Bar > Allow in Menu Bar for HaoBar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS may be hiding HaoBar's icons. Check System Settings > Menu Bar > Allow in Menu Bar for HaoBar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 可能正在隐藏 HaoBar 的图标。请到系统设置 > 菜单栏 > 允许在菜单栏中，确认 HaoBar 已开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 可能正在隱藏 HaoBar 的圖示。請到系統設定 > 選單列 > 允許在選單列中，確認 HaoBar 已開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS says HaoBar's menu bar items are visible, but their windows are detached. Check System Settings > Menu Bar > Allow in Menu Bar for HaoBar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS says HaoBar's menu bar items are visible, but their windows are detached. Check System Settings > Menu Bar > Allow in Menu Bar for HaoBar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 说 HaoBar 的菜单栏项目是可见的，但窗口已脱离。请到系统设置 > 菜单栏 > 允许出现在菜单栏中，检查 HaoBar。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 說 HaoBar 的選單列項目是可見的，但視窗已脫離。請到系統設定 > 選單列 > 允許出現在選單列中，檢查 HaoBar。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS上はHaoBarの項目は表示中ですが、ウィンドウが離れています。システム設定 > メニューバー > メニューバーに表示を許可 でHaoBarを確認。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS는 HaoBar 메뉴 막대 항목이 보인다고 하지만 윈도우가 떨어져 있습니다. 시스템 설정 > 메뉴 막대 > 메뉴 막대에 허용에서 HaoBar를 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS sagt, HaoBars Objekte seien sichtbar, aber ihre Fenster sind getrennt. Prüfe Systemeinstellungen > Menüleiste > In der Menüleiste erlauben für HaoBar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS dit que les éléments HaoBar sont visibles, mais leurs fenêtres sont détachées. Vérifiez Réglages Système > Barre des menus > Autoriser dans la barre des menus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS dice que los elementos de HaoBar están visibles, pero sus ventanas están separadas. Revisa Ajustes del Sistema > Barra de menús > Permitir en la barra de menús."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS diz que os itens do HaoBar estão visíveis, mas as janelas estão desanexadas. Confira Ajustes do Sistema > Barra de menus > Permitir na barra de menus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS dice che gli elementi di HaoBar sono visibili, ma le finestre sono scollegate. Controlla Impostazioni di Sistema > Barra dei menu > Consenti nella barra dei menu."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS zegt dat HaoBars items zichtbaar zijn, maar hun vensters zijn los. Controleer Systeeminstellingen > Menubalk > Sta toe in de menubalk."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS nói mục HaoBar đang hiện, nhưng cửa sổ đã tách. Kiểm tra Cài đặt Hệ thống > Thanh menu > Cho phép trên thanh menu."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS บอกว่ารายการ HaoBar มองเห็น แต่หน้าต่างหลุดแล้ว ไปที่ตั้งค่าระบบ > แถบเมนู > อนุญาตในแถบเมนู"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS bilang item HaoBar terlihat, tetapi jendelanya terlepas. Periksa Pengaturan Sistem > Bilah Menu > Izinkan di Bilah Menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
