    "SaneBar is fully open source and free to use. If you love what I do and believe in privacy-first Mac apps, here's how you can help.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar is fully open source and free to use. If you love what I do and believe in privacy-first Mac apps, here's how you can help."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar 完全开源、免费使用。若你喜欢我做的事、也认同隐私优先的 Mac 应用，可以这样支持。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar 完全開源、免費使用。若你喜歡我做的事、也認同隱私優先的 Mac 應用程式，可以這樣支持。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBarは完全オープンソースで無料です。プライバシー第一のMacアプリを応援してくれるなら、こう手伝ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar는 완전 오픈 소스이고 무료입니다. 제가 하는 일과 프라이버시 우선 Mac 앱을 믿는다면, 이렇게 도와주시면 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar ist vollständig Open Source und kostenlos. Wenn dir datenschutzfreundliche Mac-Apps wichtig sind, kannst du so helfen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar est entièrement open source et gratuit. Si vous aimez ce que je fais et les apps Mac qui respectent la vie privée, voici comment aider."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar es totalmente de código abierto y gratis. Si te gustan las apps Mac que ponen la privacidad primero, así puedes ayudar."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O SaneBar é totalmente código aberto e grátis. Se você gosta do que faço e de apps Mac que colocam a privacidade primeiro, eis como ajudar."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar è interamente open source e gratuito. Se ti stanno a cuore le app Mac che mettono la privacy al primo posto, ecco come aiutare."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar is volledig open source en gratis. Als je privacy-eerst Mac-apps steunt, kun je zo helpen."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar hoàn toàn mã nguồn mở và miễn phí. Nếu bạn thích những gì tôi làm và tin app Mac coi trọng riêng tư, đây là cách giúp."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar เปิดซอร์สเต็มและใช้ฟรี ถ้าชอบสิ่งที่ผมทำและเชื่อในแอป Mac ที่ให้ความเป็นส่วนตัวก่อน นี่คือวิธีช่วย"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar sepenuhnya sumber terbuka dan gratis. Jika Anda suka yang saya kerjakan dan percaya pada app Mac yang mengutamakan privasi, begini caranya membantu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SaneBar is now fully open source and free for everyone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SaneBar is now fully open source and free for everyone."
